---
import QianliLayout from "../../layouts/QianliLayout.astro";
import Screenshot from "../../components/QianliScreenshot.astro";
---
<QianliLayout>
  <section class="q-hero q-wrap" aria-labelledby="q-title">
    <div class="q-hero-copy">
      <div class="q-identity">
        <img src="/assets/qianli/appicon-1024.png" alt="潜历 App 图标" width="1024" height="1024" class="q-icon" />
        <div><p class="q-name">潜历</p><p class="q-label">Qianli for iPhone</p></div>
      </div>
      <h1 id="q-title">什么时候，<br />去哪潜？</h1>
      <p class="q-body">想潜水的时候，先看看世界上哪里正合适。<br class="q-desktop-break" />潜历把季节、签证、交通和行程放在一起，<br class="q-desktop-break" />帮你决定下一次去哪。</p>
      <button class="q-store" type="button" disabled>App Store · 即将上线</button>
      <p class="q-decision">月份 <span>×</span> 季节 <span>×</span> 签证 <span>×</span> 交通</p>
    </div>
    <div class="q-hero-visual">
      <div class="q-hero-crop">
        <img src="/assets/qianli/calendar-home-final.png" alt="潜历月历首页局部：从九月出发，查看全球潜水季节" width="1206" height="2622" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" />
      </div>
      <p class="q-visual-note"><span aria-hidden="true">01 /</span> 从一个月份，找到下一站。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="q-section q-wrap q-time" aria-labelledby="time-title">
    <div class="q-section-heading">
      <p class="q-kicker">01 <span>/</span> 时间与季节</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="time-title">先看时间，<br />再看地方。</h2>
        <p class="q-body">不用先想好目的地。<br />选一个月份，看看世界上哪些地方正值好季节。</p>
        <p class="q-aside">有具体假期，也可以直接按日期范围来看。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="q-pair q-time-screens">
      <Screenshot name="calendar-home" alt="月历首页：月份选择、全球目的地地图及潜水季节图例" caption="以月份，看看全世界" number="01.1" />
      <Screenshot name="date-range" alt="日期范围选择：按具体假期查看潜水目的地" caption="以假期，找到合适的窗口" number="01.2" />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="q-section q-wrap" aria-labelledby="planner-title">
    <div class="q-section-heading">
      <p class="q-kicker">02 <span>/</span> 出发规划</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="planner-title">假期定了，<br />目的地还没有。</h2>
        <p class="q-body">从出发城市、日期、潜水方式和证书开始，<br class="q-desktop-break" />把候选目的地缩到真正适合这一趟的范围。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="q-pair q-planner-screens">
      <Screenshot name="go-planner" alt="出发规划：设置出发城市、旅行日期、潜水方式及证书" caption="先把这一趟的条件选好" number="02.1" />
      <Screenshot name="go-results" alt="出发规划结果：根据旅行条件筛选出的候选目的地" caption="再看看，哪里适合出发" number="02.2" />
    </div>
    <aside class="q-wildlife" aria-labelledby="wildlife-title">
      <div><p class="q-kicker">另一种出发点</p><h3 id="wildlife-title">想看鲸鲨？</h3><p class="q-body">也可以从生物开始找。</p></div>
      <Screenshot name="search-wildlife-whaleshark" alt="生物搜索：搜索鲸鲨，查看相关潜水目的地" caption="把想见的生物，作为出发点" number="02.3" />
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="q-section q-wrap" aria-labelledby="destination-title">
    <div class="q-section-heading">
      <p class="q-kicker">03 <span>/</span> 目的地功课</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="destination-title">知道什么时候适合去，<br />还不够。</h2>
        <p class="q-body">怎么去、需要什么水平、签证怎么办、<br class="q-desktop-break" />有哪些值得注意的地方，<br class="q-desktop-break" />才决定了一趟潜水旅行能不能真的成行。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="q-trio q-destination-screens">
      <Screenshot name="site-detail-sanya" alt="三亚目的地详情：目的地概览与潜水信息" caption="了解目的地" number="03.1" />
      <Screenshot name="practical-info" alt="目的地实用信息：体验口碑、价格参考和避坑提醒" caption="做好出发前的功课" number="03.2" />
      <Screenshot name="transport-info" alt="目的地交通信息：抵达目的地的交通方式" caption="把怎么去也想清楚" number="03.3" />
    </div>
    <p class="q-boundary">潜历不替你推荐潜店或酒店，<br class="q-desktop-break" />只把目的地本身需要做的功课整理清楚。</p>
  </section>
  <section class="q-section q-wrap" aria-labelledby="trip-title">
    <div class="q-section-heading">
      <p class="q-kicker">04 <span>/</span> 行程与记录</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="trip-title">从想去，<br />到真的去过。</h2>
        <p class="q-body">决定好目的地以后，把它变成一趟行程。<br class="q-desktop-break" />出发前留好待办和提醒，<br class="q-desktop-break" />回来以后把潜次和照片留下来。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="q-trio q-trip-screens">
      <Screenshot name="trip-list" alt="行程列表：保存的潜水旅行计划" caption="从一趟行程开始" number="04.1" />
      <Screenshot name="trip-detail" alt="行程详情：出发前的计划、待办与提醒" caption="把计划留在手边" number="04.2" />
      <Screenshot name="dive-history-photo" alt="潜水记录：旅行后留下的潜次与照片" caption="把下水的记忆留下来" number="04.3" />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="q-final q-wrap" aria-labelledby="final-title">
    <p class="q-kicker">下一站，等你决定</p>
    <h2 id="final-title">下一次下水，<br />从这里开始。</h2>
    <div class="q-identity">
      <img src="/assets/qianli/appicon-1024.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" class="q-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <div><p class="q-name">潜历</p><p class="q-label">Qianli for iPhone</p></div>
    </div>
    <button class="q-store" type="button" disabled>App Store · 即将上线</button>
    <nav class="q-help" aria-label="潜历产品信息">
      <a href="/qianli/privacy/">隐私政策 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/qianli/support/">支持与帮助 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</QianliLayout>
